me.Value</Value><Direction>Descending</Direction></SortExpression><SortExpression><Value>=Fields!txtNoteSubmitBySurname.Value</Value></SortExpression><SortExpression><Value>=Fields!txtNoteSubmitByFirstname.Value</Value></SortExpression></SortExpressions><TablixMembers><TablixMember /></TablixMembers></TablixMember><TablixMember><Visibility><Hidden>=IIF(isNothing(Fields!TblPupilManagementNotesID.Value),false,true)</Hidden></Visibility><KeepWithGroup>Before</KeepWithGroup></TablixMember></TablixMembers></TablixRowHierarchy><Filters><Filter><FilterExpression>=IIF(isNothing(Fields!TblPupilManagementNotesID.Value),false,true)</FilterExpression><Operator>Equal</Operator><FilterValues><FilterValue DataType="Boolean">=true</FilterValue></FilterValues></Filter></Filters><Top>1.9cm</Top><Height>2.6cm</Height><Width>20cm</Width><ZIndex>2</ZIndex><Style><Border><Style>None</Style></Border></Style></Tablix><Image Name="Image13"><Source>External</Source><Value>
